v## All On-Chain Frontend Features — Certified Assets (Static Site)

Here is a complete list of features from the knowledge sources, organized by category:

---

### ✅ Automatic (No Configuration Needed)

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Response certification** | Every response is certified via a proof tree; no uncertified path exists |
| **Clean URLs** | `.html` files get extension-less canonical URLs automatically (e.g. `about.html` → `/about`) |
| **Compression** | gzip + Brotli stored and negotiated per request via `Accept-Encoding` |
| **ETag / 304 Not Modified** | Content-hash ETag; unchanged files are not re-downloaded |
| **Default 404 page** | Built-in certified 404 for unmatched paths (replaceable with your own `404.html`) |
| **`ic_env` cookie** | Injected on HTML responses; carries `PUBLIC_*` env vars (canister IDs) and root key |

[[What You Get Automatically](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/static-site/#what-you-get-automatically)]

---

### ⚙️ Configurable via `_redirects`

| Feature | Syntax |
|---|---|
| **SPA fallback / rewrite** | `/* /index.html 200` |
| **Permanent redirect** | `/old /new 301` |
| **Temporary redirect** | `/discord https://discord.gg/example 302` |
| **Pretty URL rewrite** | `/article /content/article.html 200` |
| **Subtree redirect** | `/docs/v1/* /docs/v2/ 301` |
| **Custom error pages** | `/secret /403.html 404` |

[[SPA Routing & Redirects](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/static-site/#spa-routing-and-redirects-_redirects)]

---

### ⚙️ Configurable via `_headers`

| Feature | Example |
|---|---|
| **Security headers (CSP, X-Frame-Options, etc.)** | `Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'` |
| **Cache control** | `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable` |
| **Content-Type override** | `Content-Type: text/markdown` (for extension-less files) |
| **Set-Cookie** | Any cookie name except `ic_env` |
| **Referrer policy** | `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin` |

[[Custom Headers](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/static-site/#custom-headers-_headers)]

> ⚠️ **No default headers are added** — you must declare all security/cache headers yourself. [[No Default Headers](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/guides/frontends/static-site/headers/#no-headers-are-added-for-you)]

---

### 🔒 Access Protection (Controller-Only)

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Enable/disable protection** | Gate the site behind a login page |
| **Issue / revoke tokens** | Mint access tokens for private/preview sites |
| **List live tokens** | View tokens with expiry |

[[Certified Assets Interface](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/references/application-canisters/#certified-assets-canister)]

---

### ❌ NOT Supported (On-Chain Limitations)

| Feature | Reason |
|---|---|
| **Dynamic `:splat` / `:placeholder` routing** | Responses must be enumerable and certified ahead of time |
| **Server-side rendering (SSR)** | Canisters cannot run JS at the server level |
| **Dynamic URL routing at server level** | Only static files are served |
| **`AssetManager` JS SDK uploads** | That targets the legacy canister, not static-site |
| **`.ic-assets.json5` config** | Legacy asset canister only; ignored here |

[[Dynamic Rules](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/guides/frontends/static-site/redirects/#what-isnt-supported-dynamic-rules)] [[Pitfalls](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/static-site/#pitfalls)]

