### 🚫 Reserved Headers (Rejected at Deploy Time)

`Content-Length`, `Content-Encoding`, `ETag`, `Transfer-Encoding`, `Accept-Ranges`, `Content-Range`, `IC-Certificate`, `IC-CertificateExpression`, `Location`

[[Reserved Headers](https://docs.internetcomputer.org/guides/frontends/static-site/headers/#reserved-headers)]